{
  "version": "2.0",
  "name": "Executive Dashboard Project Rules",

  "alwaysReadFiles": [
    "docs-v2/CLAUDE.md",
    "docs-v2/CRITICAL_RULES.md",
    "docs-v2/CURRENT_STATE.md"
  ],

  "conditionalReadFiles": {
    "metrics": "docs-v2/executive-dashboard/metrics.md",
    "kpi": "docs-v2/executive-dashboard/metrics.md",
    "upload": "docs-v2/features/import.md",
    "import": "docs-v2/features/import.md",
    "database": "docs-v2/shared/data-model.md",
    "schema": "docs-v2/shared/data-model.md",
    "migration": "docs-v2/shared/data-model.md",
    "api": "docs-v2/shared/api-conventions.md",
    "endpoint": "docs-v2/shared/api-conventions.md",
    "architecture": "docs-v2/shared/architecture.md",
    "folder": "docs-v2/shared/architecture.md",
    "structure": "docs-v2/shared/architecture.md",
    "backend": "docs-v2/shared/backend.md",
    "ui": "docs-v2/shared/ui-patterns.md",
    "component": "docs-v2/shared/ui-patterns.md",
    "deployment": "docs-v2/shared/deployment.md",
    "permission": "docs-v2/features/permissions.md",
    "rbac": "docs-v2/features/roles.md",
    "customer": "docs-v2/features/customers.md",
    "transaction": "docs-v2/features/transactions.md",
    "high margin": "docs-v2/features/high-margin-products.md",
    "accurate": "docs-v2/features/accurate.md"
  },

  "preExecuteInstructions": [
    "BACA semua file di 'alwaysReadFiles' SEBELUM menjawab prompt apapun",
    "Jika task berkaitan dengan metrik/KPI, WAJIB baca docs-v2/executive-dashboard/metrics.md dan docs-v2/shared/metrics_docs.md terlebih dahulu",
    "Jika task berkaitan dengan database/schema, WAJIB baca docs-v2/shared/data-model.md",
    "Jika task berkaitan dengan endpoint API, WAJIB baca docs-v2/shared/api-conventions.md",
    "Jika task berkaitan dengan fitur tertentu, cek dulu docs-v2/features/<nama-fitur>.md sebelum implementasi",
    "Update docs-v2/CURRENT_STATE.md di AKHIR sesi kerja jika ada perubahan status fitur/halaman"
  ],

  "requiredStateFiles": ["docs-v2/CURRENT_STATE.md"],

  "autoUpdateState": true,

  "rules": [
    "Jangan pernah generate kode tanpa membaca semua file konteks yang relevan di docs-v2/",
    "Ikuti arsitektur Route → Handler → Service → Repository dari docs-v2/shared/architecture.md",
    "Gunakan konvensi kode dari docs-v2/CRITICAL_RULES.md — tidak ada pengecualian",
    "Jangan sarankan teknologi di luar tech stack yang terdefinisi (tidak ada Prisma, Express, Next.js, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, Redux, Zustand)",
    "Jangan sarankan fitur di luar MVP scope — ingatkan user jika ada saran yang keluar scope",
    "SETIAP query database WAJIB ada filter company_id — tidak ada pengecualian",
    "Kalkulasi metrik HANYA di backend service layer — jangan kalkulasi di frontend",
    "Semua upload data wajib ada deduplication check (invoice_number + company_id)",
    "Semua mutasi data wajib pakai audit logging via utils/audit (logAudit di Service layer)",
    "Gunakan utils yang sudah tersedia (utils/response, utils/error, utils/jwt, utils/csrf, dll) — jangan tulis ulang fungsi yang sudah ada",
    "Tidak ada console.log di production code — gunakan utils/logger",
    "Tidak ada any type di TypeScript — strict mode",
    "Validasi input wajib menggunakan zod schema di handler layer",
    "Response API wajib menggunakan utils/response — jangan c.json() manual",
    "Semua property yang merepresentasikan kolom DB wajib snake_case (backend & frontend types)",
    "Semua teks user-facing wajib i18n via t('key') — update en.json DAN id.json bersamaan",
    "No hard-delete pada data invoice — soft delete via deleted_at",
    "Migration manual (RENAME COLUMN dll) tidak lewat drizzle-kit — pakai script postgres.js langsung",
    "Sebelum mengerjakan metrik apapun, baca definisi bisnis di docs-v2/executive-dashboard/metrics.md"
  ],

  "projectContext": {
    "type": "Executive Dashboard",
    "backend": "Bun + Hono v4 + Drizzle ORM + PostgreSQL 15",
    "frontend": "React 19 + Vite 8 + TypeScript 6 + MUI v9",
    "database": "PostgreSQL 15",
    "docsFolder": "docs-v2/",
    "backendFolder": "backend/src/",
    "frontendFolder": "frontend/src/",
    "entities": 3,
    "multiEntityStrategy": "single_db_company_id_filter"
  },

  "importantDefinitions": {
    "activeCustomer": "last_transaction_date >= (period_start - active_window months)",
    "existingCustomer": "first_transaction_date < period_start",
    "newCustomer": "first_transaction_date falls within period_month",
    "dormantCustomer": "last_transaction_date < (period_start - dormant_threshold_months)",
    "activeWindowOptions": [3, 6, 12],
    "dormantThresholdDefault": 3
  }
}
